  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Alma",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 28,
    "summary": "The Lamanites are defeated in a tremendous battle—Tens of thousands are slain—The wicked are consigned to a state of endless woe; the righteous attain a never-ending happiness. About 77–76 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And now it came to pass that after the people of Ammon were established in the land of Jershon, and a church also established in the land of Jershon, and the armies of the Nephites were set round about the land of Jershon, yea, in all the borders round about the land of Zarahemla; behold the armies of the Lamanites had followed their brethren into the wilderness.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 87,
            "end": 94,
            "text": "Alma 27:22; 30:19 (1, 19)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 28:1",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And thus there was a tremendous battle; yea, even such an one as never had been known among all the people in the land from the time Lehi left Jerusalem; yea, and tens of thousands of the Lamanites were slain and scattered abroad.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 28:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, and also there was a tremendous slaughter among the people of Nephi; nevertheless, the Lamanites were driven and scattered, and the people of Nephi returned again to their land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 107,
            "end": 113,
            "text": "Alma 30:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Alma 30:1.",
            "prettyString": "Alma 30:1",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "alma",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 30,
                    "end": 30,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 1,
                        "end": 1
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 28:3",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And now this was a time that there was a great mourning and lamentation heard throughout all the land, among all the people of Nephi—",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 55,
            "text": "TG Mourning."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Mourning.",
            "prettyString": "TG Mourning",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Mourning",
                "entryId": "tg-mourning",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 28:4",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, the cry of widows mourning for their husbands, and also of fathers mourning for their sons, and the daughter for the brother, yea, the brother for the father; and thus the cry of mourning was heard among all of them, mourning for their kindred who had been slain.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "TG Widows."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
